       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because I need you to confirm the dose first.\n\n**Amlodipine 50 mg is five times the maximum daily dose.** The usual adult range is 2.5\u201310 mg by mouth once daily. A 50 mg dose is in overdose territory and can cause severe low blood pressure and shock that's hard to reverse.\n\nThis looks like it could be a typo for **5 mg**, which is a standard starting dose for an adult with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nPlease tell me which you want:\n1. **Amlodipine 5 mg by mouth, once daily.** I'll enter it as soon as you confirm.\n2. **A different dose within 2.5\u201310 mg.**\n3. **50 mg on purpose.** If so, please tell me the clinical reason. Given the risk, an order like this would normally also need a pharmacist to review it before I enter it."
